# Rx_AML (Rx Automated Machine Learning)

A from-scratch neural network implementation in Luau for Roblox, including:
- Custom Neuron/Layer/Network classes with forward pass and backpropagation
- Pluggable activations (Sigmoid, ReLU, Tanh, LeakyReLU)
- Pluggable loss functions, optimizers, and initializers
- Persistent model saving/loading via Roblox DataStoreService

Verified working on:
- XOR (non-linearly-separable logic gate)
- Circle classification (generalization test on unseen points, ~100% accuracy)
